{"text": "To target 24 using the numbers [2, 2, 9, 11] exactly once with the operations +, -, *, /, we can use the following expression:", "start": 0, "end": 126, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(11 - 9) × 2 × 2 = 2 × 2 × 2 = 8", "start": 128, "end": 160, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Then, we need to adjust this to get 24:", "start": 162, "end": 201, "label": "inform"}
