{"text": "Final correct way is:", "start": 713, "end": 734, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(11 - 2) × (9 / 3) = 9 × 3 = 27", "start": 736, "end": 767, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Finally, the correct combination is:", "start": 769, "end": 805, "label": "inform"}
